[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0010","text":"……嗯，Okay"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0020","text":"──────……！\n是！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0023","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0024","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0030","text":"————给你水"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0040","text":"……！\n谢谢您……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0050","text":"────\n水、水……拿到了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0060","text":"那个────莫非\n在窄地方练转圈的，是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0070","text":"如果在货架缝隙里转圈不碰到任何东西的话\n那在升降台上应该也很简单，我是这么想的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0080","text":"对、对不起………说得也是呢\n美琴小姐的话，肯定能转的，我却……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0090","text":"不不，我才该道歉\n没想到你会那样来阻止我"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0100","text":"就算是升降台\n我也想做些亮点出来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0110","text":"──\n美琴小姐……果然是偶像呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0120","text":"……我一直\n都想着要成为那样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0130","text":"但是，我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0140","text":"没能好好当个偶像\n净给美琴小姐添麻烦…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0150","text":"────如果觉得是添麻烦的话\n那就只能练习了……而且……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0160","text":"觉得自己不是偶像的话，\n那就已经不是偶像了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0170","text":"当不了偶像的人，\n我是不会和她组队的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0180","text":"…………\n好的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0190","text":"我觉得你的铅笔转，做得不错"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07010000_06_0200","text":"……！\n好、好的……！"}]
